What:		/sys/class/drm/card<N>-eDP-<M>/notch
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.3
Contact:	dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org
Description:
		(RW) Present on the built-in panel connector of an Apple
		display controller (appledrm) when the panel has notch rows
		(apple,notch-height). Reads "shown" or "hidden": whether
		compositors are offered the full panel, notch rows included,
		or the notch-free geometry. It is the connector's "notch"
		property. Writing "shown", "hidden" or a boolean (1/0, on/off,
		y/n) commits that property and makes compositors and the
		console probe the connector again. The text console always
		uses the notch-free geometry. The value starts as the boot
		loader's choice (chosen/asahi,show-notch). See
		Documentation/gpu/apple-dcp-notch.rst.
